# Hotwire / Turbo Integration Patterns

> Canonical methodology: `.agents/skills/integration-regression-review/SKILL.md`  
> Functional runs: `.agents/skills/functional-verification-review/SKILL.md`  
> **Search + pagination / page overflow:** `.cursor/rules/paginated-list-patterns.mdc`

Use this table during `/review-staged` **regression sweep**. Each row: trace code → mark PASS / FAIL / N/A.

---

## Pattern catalog

| ID | Trigger in diff | What breaks | Repro (short) | Sev |
|----|-----------------|-------------|---------------|-----|
| **TURBO-URL-01** | `turbo_action: advance` on list frame + row opens modal via `Turbo.visit(member_path)` | Pagination/filter links keep `:id` → wrong path | Open detail → click page 2 → check URL is index path | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-SYNC-01** | `turbo_frame` updates list; counter/header **outside** frame | Total count / summary stale after filter/search | Search keyword → header count unchanged | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-HIST-01** | Modal create/update via `turbo_stream` without `history.replaceState` | URL stuck on `/new` or POST path; F5 breaks | Create via modal → check address bar → refresh | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-FORM-01** | `form_with` in modal; edit has explicit `method:` but new does not | Wrong HTTP verb when URL is member path | Open detail → open new modal → submit → Network tab | 🟡 |
| **TURBO-FORM-02** | Multipart PATCH in modal without `html: { method: "post" }` | Edit save fails or wrong verb (Rails spoofing) | Edit series with image upload → Network tab | 🟡 |
| **TURBO-FRAME-02** | Nested turbo frame form submits inside wrong frame | Link-houses picker submit trapped in modal frame | Submit link houses from edit modal | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-PAGE-01** | `paginate()` without `params: { controller:, action:, id: nil }` on custom index route | Kaminari generates member URLs | Same as TURBO-URL-01 | 🟠 |
| **I18N-TEMPLATE-01** | `*_template` locale with `__COUNT__` for Stimulus replace | Dynamic label ≠ static `*_with_selected_count` | Tick checkboxes in picker → compare JA copy | 🟡 |
| **CSS-LINEHEIGHT-01** | `min-height: calc(var(--font-size) + …)` but `line-height: tight` or different token | Text clipped / misaligned in table or hero | Long name in list row or detail hero | 🟡 |
| **STIMULUS-REG-01** | New controller in `index.js` without import/register | Controller never connects — silent no-op | Feature appears in HTML `data-controller` but no behavior | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-TEMP-01** | Stimulus mutates list/card DOM, then `Turbo.visit` / frame load validates record | Frame missing / 404 after UI already swapped to invalid item | Force out-of-scope after list fetch → pick item that reloads frame → previous UI must stay | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-TEMP-02** | Shared `frame-missing` / error handler clears entire results region | Soft failure wipes happy-path list | Trigger frame error mid-flow → only scoped status/message, not empty panel | 🟠 |
| **API-PAR-01** | Second JSON endpoint builds cards for same renderer without shared serialize | Card after step 2 missing badges / shows raw enum | Compare Network payloads of both endpoints for same renderer fields | 🟠 |
| **PRELINE-STALE-01** | Nested overlay teleported to `body` with a **shared** DOM id across records | Open record A edit modal → save/close → open record B → child modal still shows A's field values (parent preview may be correct) | Open proposal 1 memo → save → open proposal 2 memo; textarea must match proposal 2 | 🟠 |
| **PRELINE-BACKDROP-01** | `turbo_stream.replace` of open Preline overlay then `HSOverlay.open` again (esp. 422 re-render) | Backdrops stack → screen darkens; success toast behind black veil | Fail validation 2–3× → inspect `.hs-overlay-backdrop` / feature backdrop class count; save OK must leave ≤1 parent dimmer | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-MODAL-01** | 422/error stream replaces **parent** turbo frame while form lives in body-teleported modal | Host `disconnect` removes body modal; error banner never shows; modal looks “stuck” | Submit invalid nested modal → Network 422 + stream target; UI must show field errors on open modal | 🟠 |
| **STIMULUS-BOOL-01** | `data-*-open-value="<%= @flag %>"` when `@flag` is `nil` | Empty attribute → Stimulus Boolean = **true** → modal auto-opens | Open parent only → child must stay closed until explicit open or intentional `open=true` | 🟠 |
| **CSS-OVERFLOW-01** | Text / preview / label–value rows / chips without `overflow-wrap` or `min-width: 0` on the value cell and ancestors | Long unbroken tokens (IDs, URLs, chip labels) blow layout horizontally; chip rows stay on one line and overflow | Paste a long ID/URL or many chips into a detail row → container must wrap / wrap chips, not widen the page or modal | 🟡 |
| **TURBO-VALID-01** | HTML `maxlength` + model `length: { maximum: N }` | Browser blocks paste → never hits server 422 / error UI path | Know both layers exist; for QA of server errors temporarily omit `maxlength` or remove via DevTools | 🟡 |
| **TURBO-STREAM-HOOK-01** | Listener on `turbo:after-stream-render` to re-wire buttons/UI after stream | Hook **never fires** on Turbo 8.0.x → UI stuck disabled after status/memo stream | Save status/memo → replace buttons must re-enable; use `turbo:before-stream-render` and wrap `event.detail.render` (chain existing wrappers) | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-AUTOSAVE-01** | Checkbox/field `change` → immediate PATCH without debounce/coalesce | Abort storms; last selection lost; race with status submit | Rapid-toggle options → Network one-in-flight; final DB matches last UI | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-AUTOSAVE-02** | Field-only PATCH always `turbo_stream.replace` whole detail modal | Scroll jumps to top on every toggle | Toggle option mid-scroll → scroll position preserved (`204` or history-only streams) | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-AUTOSAVE-03** | Autosave `fetch` ignores `!response.ok` / network errors | UI checked, DB unchanged; user thinks saved | DevTools Offline → toggle → toast or revert (or documented Manual QA gap → 🟡) | 🟡 |
| **TURBO-AUTOSAVE-04** | Status/memo submit while option autosave in flight (or pending debounce) | Older PATCH acquires lock after submit → persisted choices revert to stale set | Toggle A → wait for Network in-flight → change to B → save status → DB choices = B | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-LIVE-CTX-01** | History/detail open without `live_context` (or equivalent) when replace/options must stay editable | After Turbo refresh, change-house/land stay disabled / options read-only | Open in-meeting history row → edit options + replace still available after status PATCH | 🟠 |
| **CSS-BTN-HOVER-01** | Feature footer overrides `.ahm-modal-button-*:hover` to **same** colors as default | No visible hover; feels broken | Hover 編集/閉じる/キャンセル — bg must change; prefer tokens (`--ahm-color-surface` / `--ahm-color-text-heading`) | 🟡 |
| **TURBO-MODAL-URL-01** | Canonical deep-link full-page `show` reuses detail-modal `.includes` / Preloader | Bullet `AVOID eager loading`; wasted queries; alert storm on paste URL | Paste `/index/:id` → no Bullet unused-include alerts; modal still opens via frame request | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-MODAL-URL-02** | `load_index_collection` overwrites detail ivar (`@house_series`) before `*_detail_path(@record)` | `detail_url` becomes Relation/`#<…>` garbage; paste URL never auto-opens modal | Capture `detail = @record` before load collection; assert shell `data-modal-detail-url-detail-url-value` equals real path | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-MODAL-URL-03** | Row/card builds `indexUrl` from `filter_params` but list desktop/mobile never passes that local | Close modal restores bare index path — filters/`page` vanish from address bar | Search → open detail → close → URL still has `q`/filters (desktop + mobile) | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-MODAL-URL-04** | Request spec only `expect(body).to include(member_path(record))` for deep-link | False PASS — list rows already embed that path while shell `detail-url` is wrong | Assert exact `data-modal-detail-url-detail-url-value="…"` / row `data-row-link-index-url-value` with filters | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-MODAL-URL-05** | Controller A `render 'b/index'` with relative partials (`render "tabs"`) | `Missing partial a/_tabs` — deep-link 500 | `render_with_lookup_prefix('b', …)` or absolute `"b/tabs"` | 🟠 |
| **TURBO-MODAL-URL-06** | `tag.attributes({ controller:, foo_value: })` without nested `data:` | Attributes lack `data-` prefix; Stimulus never connects; auto-open no-op | View source: must see `data-controller` / `data-*-value` | 🟠 |

> Pagination overflow, search+page param bugs → use **`paginated-list-patterns.mdc`** (PAGE-*, PAGE-SEARCH-*), not duplicated here.  
> Serializer share + API parity while coding → `architecture/anti-patterns.mdc` §9, `implementation/controllers.mdc`.  
> Autosave detail → `.agents/skills/stimulus-turbo-autosave/SKILL.md`.  
> Canonical detail modal URLs → `.agents/skills/modal-detail-canonical-url/SKILL.md`.  
> Request specs: **never** assert modal copy/BEM — DB/HTTP + **URL-contract data attrs** only when testing deep-link (`ai-housemaker-rspec`).

