## Fix patterns (reference)

| ID | Typical fix |
|----|-------------|
| TURBO-URL-01 / TURBO-PAGE-01 | `pagination_nav(..., params: { controller:, action: "index", id: nil })` |
| TURBO-SYNC-01 | Hidden `data-total-count-text` in frame + `total-count-sync` on frame `turbo:frame-load` |
| TURBO-HIST-01 | Append ephemeral `history-replace` Stimulus node in `turbo_stream` success |
| TURBO-FORM-01 | Explicit `method: :post` on new `form_with` |
| TURBO-FORM-02 | Edit multipart: `html: { method: "post" }` + `method: :patch` |
| TURBO-FRAME-02 | `data: { turbo_frame: "_top" }` on forms that must escape modal frame |
| I18N-TEMPLATE-01 | Align template string with `*_with_selected_count` key |
| CSS-LINEHEIGHT-01 | Single `--*-line-height` token for both `min-height` calc and `line-height` |
| STIMULUS-REG-01 | Register in `app/javascript/controllers/index.js` |
| TURBO-TEMP-01 | Defer DOM commit until `turbo:frame-load` (or restore previous node on `frame-missing`) |
| TURBO-TEMP-02 | Error path: status/toast only — do not clear unrelated result lists |
| API-PAR-01 | One shared serializer/concern; labels for display; parity of FE-consumed fields |
| PRELINE-NEST-01 | Teleport nested overlay to `document.body`; host in parent frame removes it on frame disconnect |
| PRELINE-STALE-01 | Unique overlay id per record; clear teleported orphans **before** opening another detail; host `disconnect` must **not** delete body overlays (races with post-save frame replace → dead open button) |
| PRELINE-BACKDROP-01 | Dedicated backdrop class (e.g. `.proposal-memo-modal-backdrop`); strip orphans before `open` and on host/modal `disconnect` |
| TURBO-MODAL-01 | On validation fail, `turbo_stream.replace` the **teleported modal id** (not the whole parent detail frame) |
| STIMULUS-BOOL-01 | Always emit `'true'`/`'false'` (`flag ? 'true' : 'false'`) or omit attribute; coerce with `flag == true` in locals |
| CSS-OVERFLOW-01 | `min-width: 0` + `overflow-wrap: anywhere` (or `word-break: break-word`) on the value cell **and** shrinkable ancestors (`minmax(0, …)` grid tracks, flex children). Chip/tag rows: `flex-wrap` + `max-width: 100%` on chips. Prefer CSS-only; do not change data mapping to “fix” overflow. After editing source CSS, rebuild the compiled stylesheet if the app serves a build artifact. |
| TURBO-VALID-01 | Keep model validation; document that `maxlength` is UX-only and blocks server-error QA |
| TURBO-STREAM-HOOK-01 | Prefer `turbo:before-stream-render`; wrap `event.detail.render` and call previous render — do not rely on `turbo:after-stream-render` (Turbo 8) |
| TURBO-AUTOSAVE-01 | Debounce + serial coalesce (one in-flight; flush latest DOM) — see `stimulus-turbo-autosave` |
| TURBO-AUTOSAVE-02 | Field-only success: `head :no_content` or streams that **exclude** detail-frame replace |
| TURBO-AUTOSAVE-03 | Surface failure (toast / revert); if deferred, Manual QA + 🟡 |
| TURBO-AUTOSAVE-04 | On status/memo submit: clear debounce; if in-flight → await then `requestSubmit` once (do not abort-only) |
| TURBO-LIVE-CTX-01 | Pass `live_context=1` (or DDD equivalent) on history→detail links and re-submit on status/memo forms |
| CSS-BTN-HOVER-01 | Do not override shared button `:hover` to identical colors; use surface/heading tokens; additive `cursor: pointer` on shared `.ahm-modal-button` is OK if defaults unchanged otherwise |
| TURBO-MODAL-URL-01 | Lean find on canonical full-page; `.includes` only when `Turbo-Frame` == detail frame |
| TURBO-MODAL-URL-02 | `detail = @record` before `load_index_collection` if ivars collide |
| TURBO-MODAL-URL-03 | Pass `filter_params` / index filter locals into **every** row and card partial (desktop + mobile) |
| TURBO-MODAL-URL-04 | Spec the shell/row `data-*-url-value` attribute, not bare `include(path)` |
| TURBO-MODAL-URL-05 | Lookup prefix or absolute partial names when rendering another controller's index |
| TURBO-MODAL-URL-06 | Always `tag.attributes(data: { … })` for Stimulus |

